   "evidence": "runtime-catalog.ts apply() (lines 35-44) calls router.setModels, tracker.setModels and store.publishCatalog, but never clears ProviderTracker.modelBlocks, which is keyed by catalog id (providers.ts:444-451). Nothing in src ever deletes from modelBlocks. Discovery would usually skip a backend that isn't served before it is ever tried, so this mainly affects providers without discovery."
  },
